 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，今天就能做的事。",
   "spoken": "最后，今天就能做的事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "运营联盟链的人，写下每项安全假设依赖哪几家组织，不要只写成员可信。",
   "spoken": "运营联盟链的人，写下每项安全假设依赖哪几家组织，不要只写成员可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.9,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 3.9,
   "speechEnd": 10.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "写链码的人，查一遍本地时间和随机数，再给低熵的私有数据加盐。",
   "spoken": "写链码的人，查一遍本地时间和随机数，再给低熵的私有数据加盐。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.84,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 10.84,
   "speechEnd": 16.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "选框架的人，先核对它还有没有人维护。",
   "spoken": "选框架的人，先核对它还有没有人维护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 16.5,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 16.5,
   "speechEnd": 20.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "作为用户，听到上链了，不可篡改，先问三个问题。",
   "spoken": "作为用户，听到上链了，不可篡改，先问三个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 20.48,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 20.48,
   "speechEnd": 25.007
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "谁能写，谁能看，谁能改规则。",
   "spoken": "谁能写，谁能看，谁能改规则。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 25.42,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 25.42,
   "speechEnd": 28.695
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "你的个人数据写进联盟链之前，问清怎么删除，怎么更正。",
   "spoken": "你的个人数据写进联盟链之前，问清怎么删除，怎么更正。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 29.16,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 29.257,
   "speechEnd": 33.614
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "业务伙伴的联盟链，不等于公开可查，请对方拿出公链锚定或审计报告。",
   "spoken": "业务伙伴的联盟链，不等于公开可查，请对方拿出公链锚定或审计报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 34.1,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 34.1,
   "speechEnd": 39.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 40.32,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 40.32,
   "speechEnd": 41.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "只让熟人进门的区块链，风险在门里面。",
   "spoken": "只让熟人进门的区块链，风险在门里面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 41.9,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 41.9,
   "speechEnd": 45.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "在发证书的人，拿管理员密钥的人，达到门槛的几家成员，还有没人维护的软件上。",
   "spoken": "在发证书的人，拿管理员密钥的人，达到门槛的几家成员，还有没人维护的软件上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 46.28,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 46.28,
   "speechEnd": 53.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "门禁只回答了谁能进来，安全还取决于进来的人能做什么，规则本身有没有写对。",
   "spoken": "门禁只回答了谁能进来，安全还取决于进来的人能做什么，规则本身有没有写对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 53.86,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 53.86,
   "speechEnd": 61.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "这个答案成立的前提，是把每一个单点写下来，分给不同的组织，并且定期演练。",
   "spoken": "这个答案成立的前提，是把每一个单点写下来，分给不同的组织，并且定期演练。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 61.84,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 61.934,
   "speechEnd": 68.467
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "许可链没有消灭信任，只是把信任交给了具体的机构和人。",
   "spoken": "许可链没有消灭信任，只是把信任交给了具体的机构和人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 68.86,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 68.86,
   "speechEnd": 74.033
  },
  {
